{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>A god of gold.</b> It is You who caused this for them — You bestowed upon them gold and everything they desire; what are they to do that they not sin? A parable: a king who feeds his son and gives him drink, perfumes him, hangs a purse on his neck, and stands him at the door of a brothel — what is the son to do that he not sin?"], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:56:14.150439583Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}